# 🔍 Codebase-Aware RAG

**Query your codebase in plain English. Get answers grounded in real source code.**

[![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.11%2B-3776AB?style=for-the-badge&logo=python&logoColor=white)](https://www.python.org/)
[![FastAPI](https://img.shields.io/badge/FastAPI-0.111+-009688?style=for-the-badge&logo=fastapi&logoColor=white)](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/)
[![PostgreSQL](https://img.shields.io/badge/PostgreSQL-pgvector-4169E1?style=for-the-badge&logo=postgresql&logoColor=white)](https://github.com/pgvector/pgvector)
[![Tree-sitter](https://img.shields.io/badge/Tree--sitter-AST%20Parsing-FF6B35?style=for-the-badge)](https://tree-sitter.github.io/)
[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE)

> An **AST-aware hybrid Retrieval-Augmented Generation** system that parses your git repositories at the semantic level — understanding classes, functions, and methods — then answers natural-language questions about them with pinpoint accuracy.

</div>

---

## ✨ What Makes This Different

Most code-search tools split files by line count. **Codebase-Aware RAG splits by meaning.**

| Feature | Naive Chunking | **Codebase-Aware RAG** |
|---|---|---|
| Splitting strategy | Fixed line windows | AST-aware (class / function / method) |
| Search method | Keyword only | Hybrid: semantic vector + BM25 lexical |
| Context returned | Raw text snippets | Structured `CodeChunk` with metadata |
| Language support | Language-agnostic | Structured Python; fallback for others |
| Storage | Flat files | PostgreSQL + pgvector (1 024-d vectors) |
| Reranking | ❌ | ✅ Post-retrieval reranker |

---

## 🏗️ Architecture Overview

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                        INGESTION                            │
│                                                             │
│  Git Repo ──► RepoLoader ──► RepositoryFile[]               │
│                                    │                        │
│                               ASTChunker                    │
│                          (Tree-sitter parse)                │
│                                    │                        │
│                             CodeChunk[]                     │
│                           ┌────────┴────────┐               │
│                      CodeEmbedder       ChunkStore          │
│                      (bge-m3 via            │               │
│                       FreeLLMAPI)           │               │
│                           │   1024-d vector │               │
│                           └────────┬────────┘               │
│                                    ▼                        │
│                        PostgreSQL + pgvector                 │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                        RETRIEVAL                            │
│                                                             │
│  User Query ──► CodeEmbedder.embed_query()                  │
│                       │  1024-d vector                      │
│                 pgvector cosine search                      │
│                       │  Top-K CodeChunks                   │
│                    Reranker                                  │
│                       │                                     │
│                      LLM  (Gemini 2.5 Flash)                │
│                       │                                     │
│                    ✅ Answer                                 │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

